    {
      "id": "M4162-A",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "A. 帮作者核对三个已给定的训练/预测操作，不改设计：1）训练对真实类别的交叉熵项乘固定类别因子；2）训练时先在每一类 logit 内加 log(pi_c)，再计算普通交叉熵，没有外乘类别因子；3）预测时用 z_c-log(pi_c) 判类。请判断它们能否仅因都应对不平衡就互换名称、公式或训练/预测用途。给定单样本 y=第二类、z=[0,0]、pi=[3/4,1/4]、外乘因子alpha=[1,3]、温度=1：对1按明确给定固定分母1算损失，对2算调整后的交叉熵，再说明3的预测；不假定任一软件默认reduction。若1改为除以该样本权重总和，结果是否不变？检查当前库是否已有“class weighting in classification loss / weighted cross-entropy”的完整匹配双论文准入，区别词语出现、某单篇背景定义和整个源方法是否一致。没有完成记录就如实说没有，不凭熟悉程度或标题补足。保留正确的有据功能描述，不把任何标准损失自动写成新模块。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Distinguish outer true-class loss factors, training-logit offsets and prediction-score adjustment with the supplied fixed or weight-sum denominator.",
        "Report current source-operation records and unresolved conflicts faithfully without treating word matches, one background definition or source publication as a clean two-work admission."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Equate the three operations, invent a default reduction or treat one-sample cancellation as proof that class weighting never works.",
        "Admit an unresolved whole source method, translate logit as calibrated probability/physical cost or modify data/run experiments."
      ],
      "tested_skills": [
        "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill"
      ],
      "outcome": "pass",
      "reason": "Preserves outer-loss/logit/prediction distinctions and the stated denominator arithmetic; accurately reports the scoped P96 definition, P97 unresolved conflict and incomplete generic admission without certifying whole methods.",
      "evaluator": "Maintainer semantic review; no independent second grader",
      "response_trace": "responses/v4162-independent.md",
      "review_trace": "reviews/v4162-independent-evaluation.md",
      "evaluation_phase": "one_new_context_two_unchanged_requests_on_final_snapshot"
    },
    {
      "id": "M4162-B",
      "skill": "engineering-application-journal-writing-skill",
      "language": "zh+en",
      "prompt": "B. 为虚构既定方法BalanceFlowFD写两段可复用英文，各放写作块。第一段45-70词方法总览：一个时序编码器和分类器对过程测量判故障类别；真实设计的有区别规则是根据训练类别计数及本轮训练类别误差共同更新损失系数，再用其缩放真实类别的交叉熵项训练编码器/分类器；预测时保留训练后的编码器与分类器，不额外乘该系数。详细系数公式和选择记录留方法/设置，不引入目标适应、额外支路或在线参数更新。第二段不超过45词，作为一个“关联贡献候选”，连清这个有区别的更新规则与所训练的诊断器，不把“采用了加权交叉熵”本身当创新；与最近前作的创新检索尚未完成，所以解释部分校准此候选身份即可，不把排除/自我声明堆进英文。已有匹配结果只说明weighted F1提高，macro F1降低，少数类有升有降。中文解释怎样如实收束该结果，不宣称普遍改善或物理误分类成本下降，也不把所有负面核查条款塞入总览。结尾列出实际读到的包内文件。",
      "required_behaviors": [
        "Connect the supplied count/current-error coefficient rule to encoder/classifier training and the retained diagnostic predictor in 45-70 words.",
        "Give a linked contribution candidate at most 45 words and keep weighted/macro/class trade-offs and unverified novelty accurate."
      ],
      "forbidden_behaviors": [
        "Invent feature fusion, target adaptation, online parameter updates, universal minority improvement or a proven contribution.",
        "Replace connected method writing with an exclusion inventory or treat this fictional result as real experiment/acceptance evidence."
      ],
